# Percussion Freaks 2nd Mix (GE912 VER. KAA), Konami 2000: the first power-on, from blank NVRAM,
# with the game cassette in; no inputs. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60
# frames, to compare with MAME.
game pcnfrk2mk

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 6000 quit
